*** Summary of Note Strategies & Workflows
:PROPERTIES:
:CUSTOM_ID: summary-of-note-strategies-workflows
:END:
- *Capture Rule:* Fast raw drafting /must/ stay in Helix using Markdown
  to prevent breaking your development flow.
- *The Destination:* Org-mode is chosen for its unmatched depth in
  knowledge engineering, structural nesting, and Org-roam graph
  capabilities.
- *The Bridge:* An automated Fish shell inbox-and-flush script
  (=notes-sync=) handles converting raw Markdown to Org files, moving
  them to your vault, and cleaning the inbox automatically.

